            "rich_text_etAka8": {
              "type": "rich-text",
              "name": "Rich Text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Texas Bookman is a wholesale company established in 1983 and continues today with a tradition of fast and friendly customer service, delivering a world of remainders and overstocks to customers around the globe. We have expanded our product offering to include gifts, sidelines, puzzles, journals, new publications and more! With new titles arriving weekly, there's always a wide variety of products for your selection.<br/><br/>In 2023, Texas Bookman acquired The Speaking Tree focused on mind, body, and spirit and related titles. We are excited to offer this genre of books and merchandise to our current customers and look forward to meeting new customers looking for esoteric titles.<br/><br/>Can't find what you're looking for? Let us know at <a href=\"mailto:orders@texasbookman.com\" title=\"mailto:orders@texasbookman.com\">orders@texasbookman.com</a>. We are always on the hunt for titles our customers want and need!</p>",
                "align": "start",
                "color": "#000000",
                "max_width": 610
              },
              "blocks": {}
            }
          },
